---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact Us & Request a Quote
description: Request a tree services quote or get advice from ACT Tree Felling. Call our Southside or Northside numbers, email us or send an enquiry online.
heading: Contact us
intro: Need a quote, want advice or have a question? We'd love to hear from you.
heroActions: false
cta: false
# Headings are sentence case; button labels (site.cta) are Title Case.
quoteHeading: Request a quote
permalink: /contact/
---
{%- from "components/contact-details.njk" import contactDetails -%}
<div class="page-container grid gap-12 py-section-sm lg:grid-cols-3">
  <section id="quote" class="scroll-mt-8 lg:col-span-2" aria-labelledby="quote-heading">
    <h2 id="quote-heading" class="font-display text-3xl">{{ quoteHeading }}</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">Tell us about your trees and we'll get back to you during business hours.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 max-w-prose">{% include "components/jotform-quote.njk" %}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="h-fit rounded-card border border-line bg-card p-6" aria-labelledby="details-heading">
    <h2 id="details-heading" class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl">Get in touch</h2>
    {{ contactDetails(site, showPostal=true) }}
  </section>
</div>
